msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgid "Taiga「This situation is grave.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Esta situación es grave.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Huh?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......¿Eh?」"

msgid "Taiga「Both your lack of common sense and＿appalling conversational skills are＿straight-up lethal.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Tanto tu falta de sentido común como＿tu pésima habilidad para conversar＿son francamente letales.」"

msgid "Taiga「Did you lose a bit of brain matter along＿with your memories?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Perdiste algo de masa cerebral＿junto con tus recuerdos?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「W-Wow, that's harsh......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「V-Vaya, qué dura......」"

msgid "Taiga「This is the TV remote. This is a pen.＿Here's a piece of paper.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Este es el control de la tele. Esto es＿un bolígrafo. Aquí tienes papel.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「What do you want me to......?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Qué quieres que......?」"

msgid "Taiga「If you have the spare time to talk to＿me, it's better spent learning＿conversation skills by watching TV!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Si tienes tiempo para hablar conmigo,＿mejor úsalo para aprender habilidades＿de conversación viendo la tele!」"

msgid "Taiga「......I'm going to sleep.」"
msgstr "Taiga「......Me voy a dormir.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, okay......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah, está bien......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Taiga, someone's here.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Taiga, hay alguien aquí.」"

msgid "Taiga「............」"
msgstr "Taiga「............」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Hey.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Oye.」"

msgid "Taiga「Yeah, I can tell that someone's here.＿Obviously it's StuChi!」"
msgstr "Taiga「Sí, ya sé que hay alguien aquí.＿¡Obviamente es StuChi!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Then answer it.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Entonces atiende.」"

msgid "Taiga「You answer it!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Atiende tú!」"

msgid "Both「SHUT UP!」"
msgstr "Ambos「¡CÁLLATE!」"

msgid "Ami「W-What's your problem～? Don't take it＿out on me.」"
msgstr "Ami「¿Q-Qué les pasa～? No se＿desquiten conmigo.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Sorry, we...... Come on, Taiga, cheer up.＿Let's go.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Perdón, es que...... Vamos,＿Taiga, anímate. Vámonos.」"

msgid "Taiga「Whose fault is it? Sheesh......」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Y de quién es la culpa? Cielos......」"
